«
 'Precision' RCL 'HardwareFloatingPoint' RCL → savP savH
 « HFP 15 Precision
@@ ============================================================
@@ RTPlan — conjunction-class Earth⇄Mars round-trip optimiser (heliocentric ΔV)
@@ Optimises the outbound Earth→Mars leg (MinΔVTraj), then the return Mars→Earth
@@ leg departing after a minimum surface stay. Patched-conic, pedagogical.
@@ Author & design         : Jean Wilson
@@ Co-authors & programming : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
@@
@@ Input  : t1lo t1hi stay   ( t1lo t1hi stay -- { t1 t2 stay t3 t4 ΔVout ΔVret ΔVtot } )
@@   t1lo t1hi : Earth-departure search window (Julian Day)
@@   stay      : minimum Mars surface stay before the return search (days)
@@ Output : { t1 t2 stay t3 t4 (JD)  ΔVout ΔVret ΔVtot (km/s) }
@@ NOTE: set  1 'AstronTXPrecision' STO  for a fast pedagogical run (slow otherwise).
@@ VALIDATION (device-confirmed, AstronTXPrecision 1):
@@   2459030 2459075 500 RTPlan ->
@@     { 2459055.617 2459259.801 517.558 2459777.359 2460049.376
@@       6.31786 6.50523 12.82309 }
@@   Conjunction Earth⇄Mars: depart 2020-07-25, arrive Mars 2021-02-14 (the
@@   Perseverance window), return 2022-07-16, home 2023-04-14; 2.72 yr; ΔVtot 12.82 km/s.
@@ ============================================================
 → t1lo t1hi stay
 «
    'Ⓛ♁Pf' 'Ⓛ♂Pf' t1lo t1hi 150 250 ⓁMinΔVTraj
    → outb
    «
       outb 1 GET outb 2 GET outb 3 GET
       → dVo t1 tofo
       «
          t1 tofo +
          → t2
          «
             'Ⓛ♂Pf' 'Ⓛ♁Pf' t2 stay + t2 stay + 400 + 200 350 ⓁMinΔVTraj
             → retn
             «
                retn 1 GET retn 2 GET retn 3 GET
                → dVr t3 tofr
                «
                   t1 t2 t3 t2 - t3 t3 tofr + dVo dVr dVo dVr + 8 →List
                »
             »
          »
       »
    »
 »
savP Precision  IF savH THEN HFP ELSE SFP END
 »
»
